          "docs": "Authenticate By Certificate\n\nCreates a new session by authenticating via encrypted username and certification id.\r\n\r\n**Security:** All users.\r\n\r\n**SDK API:**  `envianceSdk.authentication.authenticateByCert(encryptedUserName, certUniqueId, onsuccess, onerror)`\r\n\r\n```\r\nPATCH /ver2/AuthenticationService.svc/sessions HTTP/1.1\r\nContent-Type: application/json; charset=UTF-8\r\n \r\n{\r\n  encryptedUserName: \"username\",\r\n  certUniqueId: \"abcd23456789\",\r\n}\r\n\r\n```\r\n\n\n"
        },
